blend_space_2d.cpp#L552\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505531055/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507250683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112308#issuecomment-3507250683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112308","id":3507250683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RDGX7","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T00:49:44Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T00:49:44Z","body":"\r\nCompiled with `scons compiledb=yes debug_symbols=yes linker=mold production=yes lto=none`\r\nRan with `./engine_binary --headless --print-fps --path /path/to/project res://path_to_world.tscn`\r\nProject: [optimize.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23435265/optimize.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\nScene: \"res://World_StressTest.tscn\"\r\n\r\nBefore this patch (0fdbf05)\r\n\r\nFPS: high 89, low 86, median 88\r\nMSPF: high 11.62, low 11.23, median 11.36\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\nFPS: high 122, low 119, median 121\r\nMSPF: high 8.40, low 8.19, median 8.26\r\n\r\nmedian FPS  change: +33    (+37.50%)\r\nmedian MSPF change: -3.10   (-27.29%)\r\n    \r\n---\r\nScene: \"res://World.tscn\"\r\n\r\nBefore this patch (0fdbf05)\r\n\r\nFPS: high 176, low 170, median 175\r\nMSPF: high 5.88, low 5.68, median 5.71\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\nFPS: high 351, low 330, median 347\r\nMSPF: high 3.03, low 2.84, median 2.88\r\n\r\nmedian FPS  change: +172    (+98.29%)\r\nmedian MSPF change: -2.83   (-49.56%)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507250683/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":9,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507736033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112308#issuecomment-3507736033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112308","id":3507736033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RE83h","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T08:56:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T08:56:25Z","body":"From a behavior standpoint, I think it's fine. I don't foresee any major issues to merge it at this stage, but I plan to decide on its approval at the next AnimationMeeting just in case.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507736033/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593493031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112308#issuecomment-3593493031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112308","id":3593493031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WMFon","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T21:33:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-30T21:33:34Z","body":"And I recommend splitting this into several PRs. The reason is to make it easier to focus on reviewing each feature in more detail and, if any issues arise, only part of the changes need to be reverted.\r\n\r\nSo I assume it can likely be split into the following five PRs:\r\n\r\n- NodePath changes\r\n- HashMap and Skeleton3D changes\r\n- Animation and AnimationMixer changes\r\n- AnimationPlayer changes\r\n- AnimationTree changes\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593493031/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600674490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112308#issuecomment-3600674490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112308","id":3600674490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wne66","user":{"login":"Ryan-000","id":73148864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTQ4ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73148864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryan-000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryan-000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T07:45:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T07:45:32Z","body":"> And I recommend splitting this into several PRs. The reason is to make it easier to focus on reviewing each feature in more detail and, if any issues arise, only part of the changes need to be reverted.\r\n\r\nI agree, but splitting it now would be very painful. It's already squashed into a single commit, I don’t have a good workflow to split it apart, and many of the changes are interdependent (so I’m not sure how to structure the PRs correctly).\r\n\r\nAlthough it’s not ideal, I’d prefer to just get this PR through the door as-is. If a major issue comes up afterward, I’ll take a look and consider splitting it then.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600674490/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3601051455","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112308#issuecomment-3601051455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112308","id":3601051455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wo68_","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T09:24:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T12:19:16Z","body":"If dependencies exist, you can create a PR using that as the branch base (like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112302 tree). For example, you could create one commit for the HashMap change and then create three PRs branching from it. It also helps visualize where dependencies occur so that we can prioritize and carefully review the ancestor of the dependencies.\r\n\r\nIf they truly must be merged simultaneously, it would mean class dependencies are broken (e.g. the case that AnimationTree causes strong dependencies on AnimationPlayer). However, this PR doesn't appear to be that case, so it should be splittable.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3601051455/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3601697705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112308#issuecomment-3601697705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112308","id":3601697705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WrYup","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt